'''Evergun''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by giving 100 [[Gifts]] {{Currency|Gift}} (equivalent to a total of 80,000 [[Snow Tokens]] {{Currency|Snow Token}}) to players during the [[Christmas Event 2023|2023 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading, as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
It takes the design of a decorated evergreen Christmas tree, but in the shape of a revolver. On the top of the tree, where the muzzle would be, has a four sided golden star on it. Spiraling around the tree are soft white lights and golden tinsel. The dark brown trunk of the evergreen tree takes the place of the revolver’s handle.

==Trivia==
*It pairs with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife [[Evergreen]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Evergreen Set|Evergreen Set]].
*It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name of [[Chroma Evergun]].
*This, [[Blaster]], and [[Chroma Evergun]] are the only guns in the game to not have a trigger guard.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]]. 
*As of the [[Summer Event 2025|2025 Summer Event]]  this along with [[Evergreen]], [[Chroma Evergreen]] and [[Chroma Evergun]] received the [[FX Weapons|FX]] tag.

